": 5, "s": 24.134, "e": 28.388}, {"who": "baer", "scene": "dia", "step": 4, "text": "Ganz anders bei Microsoft. Die Cloud wächst um achtundvierzig Prozent, die Aktie springt nachbörslich um vier Prozent. Urteil: Bulle.", "line": 6, "s": 28.568, "e": 37.1}, {"who": "bulle", "scene": "duo", "face": "verwirrt", "text": "Gleiches Spiel, anderes Ergebnis?", "line": 7, "s": 37.42, "e": 39.763}, {"who": "baer", "scene": "duo", "face": "laecheln", "text": "Die Börse belohnt nicht Ausgaben. Sondern Ergebnisse.", "line": 8, "s": 40.023, "e": 44.285}, {"who": "bulle", "scene": "duo", "face": "", "text": "Und Volkswagen?", "line": 9, "s": 44.545, "e": 45.646}, {"who": "baer", "scene": "dia", "step": 5, "text": "Fünf Komma acht Milliarden Euro Verlust im Quartal. Vor allem, weil VW seine Tochter Porsche um rund sechs Milliarden abwerten musste.", "line": 10, "s": 45.966, "e": 54.52}, {"who": "bulle", "scene": "duo", "face": "schock", "text": "Sechs Milliarden einfach weg?!", "line": 11, "s": 54.84, "e": 56.998}, {"who": "baer", "scene": "duo", "face": "ueber-brille", "text": "Nur auf dem Papier, es fließt kein Geld ab. Trotzdem: Urteil: Bär.", "line": 12, "s": 57.258, "e": 62.487}, {"who": "bulle", "scene": "dia", "step": 6, "text": "Und trotzdem springt der DAX heute über sechsundzwanzigtausend Punkte!", "line": 13, "s": 62.807, "e": 66.65}, {"who": "baer", "scene": "dia", "step": 6, "text": "Und die EZB lässt den Einlagenzins bei zweieinhalb Prozent.", "line": 14, "s": 66.91, "e": 71.243}, {"who": "bulle", "scene": "duo", "face": "lacht", "text": "Und jetzt du: Bulle oder Bär? Schreib's in die Kommentare!", "line": 15, "s": 71.563, "e": 75.134}, {"who": "baer", "scene": "duo", "face": "laecheln", "text": "Morgen kommt der nächste Zoo-Ticker.", "line": 16, "s": 75.394, "e": 77.914}], "duration": 77.914, "amp": [0.002, 0.006, 0.004, 0.002, 0.007, 0.889, 0.943, 0.587, 0.206, 0.71, 0.624, 0.532, 0.037, 0.002, 0.003, 0.451, 0.326, 0.403, 0.701, 0.634, 0.666, 0.671, 0.46, 0.635, 0.7